title: 'diggs: Delineation-Informed Geographic Ground Selection'
version: 0.1.0
abstract: Interactive Shiny app for selecting historic orthophoto imagery from the
  BC Data Catalogue. Draw polygons or upload a custom AOI, filter by year/media/scale,
  view estimated photo footprints, and export selections to CSV. Built on the fly
  package for spatial photo operations.
